{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261121/photo/bkn-20261121152657809-1121_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261121175838\"/><p>事主倒地昏迷，腳部捲入車底。</p><p>北角發生交通意外。今午(21日)3時15分，一輛私家車沿福蔭道北行，當它右轉入宏安道時，意外撞倒一名姓林(72歲)過路婦人。事主頭部受傷，腳部亦被私家車的右前轆壓住，由救援人員合力救出後，清醒被送往東區醫院治療。</p><p>姓馬(50歲)私家車司機通過酒精呼氣測試，涉嫌「危險駕駛引致他人身體受嚴重傷害」被捕，現正被扣留調查。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-21T10:23:53.451091+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":181,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-21T07:26:57+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-21T12:37:15.057267+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-21T10:17:30.039534+00:00","content_hash":"9c836a158cc47d400db0734f5958474920d77a3cadc2c6d15e3026d476e84e10","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-21T10:23:53.451091+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}